<p style="
             font-size: 16px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">Output example:</p><img src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+17.png" alt="Figure 17: CSS Asset Fingerprints with Port Filter - 8,206 Results" title class="markdown-image" data-src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+17.png" data-alt="Figure 17: CSS Asset Fingerprints with Port Filter - 8,206 Results" style="
                display: block;
                margin: 1em auto -1em auto;
                max-width: 85%;
                max-height: 600px;
                cursor: zoom-in;
                overflow: hidden;
                border-radius: 6px;
                box-shadow: -1px 4px 23px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);"><span class="figure" style="
                font-size: 14px;
                color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
                font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.5;
                margin-top: 1.2em;
                text-align: center;
                font-weight: 400;
                margin-bottom: 2em;
                display: block;
                font-style: italic;
                margin-inline: auto;
                max-width: 80%;
            ">Figure 17: CSS Asset Fingerprints with Port Filter - 8,206 Results</span><h3 style="font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 1.2em;">Detection Strategy 6: TLS Certificate Fingerprints (JA4X)</h3><p style="
             font-size: 16px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">JA4X is a TLS certificate fingerprinting method that creates unique identifiers based on certificate properties including the issuer, subject, and extension information. For OpenClaw instances configured with TLS encryption, these certificate fingerprints provide a reliable identification mechanism that operates at the transport layer, independent of any HTTP-level characteristics.</p><p style="
             font-size: 16px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">Our analysis revealed that many OpenClaw deployments use self-signed certificates with distinctive organization names such as "Clawdbot", "Moltbot", or "OpenClaw" in the certificate fields. Others use certificates from common providers like Let's Encrypt, ZeroSSL, or Cloudflare. The JA4X fingerprints capture these patterns, enabling detection even when the HTTP response content has been modified or is unavailable.</p><p style="
             font-size: 16px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">This detection method found 189 instances with TLS certificates, representing the subset of deployments that have enabled HTTPS. While this is a smaller population than HTTP-only instances, TLS-enabled deployments represent a smaller subset of exposed instances and can be prioritized separately during remediation efforts.</p><p style="
             font-size: 16px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">The following query uses JA4X certificate fingerprints to identify TLS-enabled OpenClaw deployments at the transport layer.</p><p style="
             font-size: 16px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         "><strong>Query:</strong></p><pre><code class="language-sql"><code class=" language-sql" data-raw="SELECT ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
FROM httpv2
WHERE tls.cert.hash.ja4x IN (
    'a373a9f83c6b_000000000000_25294184ae24',
    'a373a9f83c6b_7022c563de38_2e3757343cb0',
    '7022c563de38_7022c563de38_795797892f9c',
    '2bab15409345_2bab15409345_795797892f9c',
    'a373a9f83c6b_7022c563de38_f64f03ad387e',
    '7d5dbb3783b4_7022c563de38_f64f03ad387e',
    '2166164053c1_2166164053c1_795797892f9c',
    'a373a9f83c6b_7022c563de38_2cdf432ec278',
    'dc020972a4a8_9fb583da09a2_fb02ba79e164'
)
AND port IN (18789, 18791)
"><span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
<span class="hljs-keyword">FROM</span> httpv2
<span class="hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> tls.cert.hash.ja4x <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (
    <span class="hljs-string">'a373a9f83c6b_000000000000_25294184ae24'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'a373a9f83c6b_7022c563de38_2e3757343cb0'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'7022c563de38_7022c563de38_795797892f9c'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'2bab15409345_2bab15409345_795797892f9c'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'a373a9f83c6b_7022c563de38_f64f03ad387e'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'7d5dbb3783b4_7022c563de38_f64f03ad387e'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'2166164053c1_2166164053c1_795797892f9c'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'a373a9f83c6b_7022c563de38_2cdf432ec278'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'dc020972a4a8_9fb583da09a2_fb02ba79e164'</span>
)
<span class="hljs-keyword">AND</span> port <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (<span class="hljs-number">18789</span>, <span class="hljs-number">18791</span>)
</code>
                <div class="code-actions"><div class="copy-trigger" style="width: 80px;
                    padding: unset !important;
                    display: flex;
