                    gap: 4px;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy-icon lucide-copy"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/></svg><span>Copy</span></div></div></code></pre>
<p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">Output example:</p><img src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+10.png" alt="Figure 10: Sorted Header Hash (Murmur3) - 8,260 Results" title class="markdown-image" data-src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+10.png" data-alt="Figure 10: Sorted Header Hash (Murmur3) - 8,260 Results" style="
                display: block;
                margin: 1em auto -1em auto;
                max-width: 85%;
                max-height: 600px;
                cursor: zoom-in;
                overflow: hidden;
                border-radius: 6px;
                box-shadow: -1px 4px 23px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);"><span class="figure" style="
                font-size: 14px;
                color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
                font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.5;
                margin-top: 1.2em;
                text-align: center;
                font-weight: 400;
                margin-bottom: 2em;
                display: block;
                font-style: italic;
                margin-inline: auto;
                max-width: 80%;
            ">Figure 10: Sorted Header Hash (Murmur3) - 8,260 Results</span><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">The following variant uses alphabetically sorted headers to validate consistency across different hash representations.</p><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         "><strong>Query (Sorted Header Hash):</strong></p><pre><code class="language-sql"><code class=" language-sql" data-raw="SELECT ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
FROM httpv2
WHERE http.headers.sorted.hash.murmur3 IN (
    'DD4CFCD07F4353B4',
    'A72AAF0B3DE14AA4',
    '91A4568E49C151BA',
    'DF5040A37382F1F6',
    'D2640C3EB53C36F4',
    'F835AFA576840DF9',
    '8E635B9BC1DD3797',
    '752822D238ABE472',
    '5D81B30A0BA1F358',
    '59F09999D5747AD9'
) AND port IN (18789, 18791)
"><span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
<span class="hljs-keyword">FROM</span> httpv2
<span class="hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> http.headers.sorted.hash.murmur3 <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (
    <span class="hljs-string">'DD4CFCD07F4353B4'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'A72AAF0B3DE14AA4'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'91A4568E49C151BA'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'DF5040A37382F1F6'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'D2640C3EB53C36F4'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'F835AFA576840DF9'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'8E635B9BC1DD3797'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'752822D238ABE472'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'5D81B30A0BA1F358'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'59F09999D5747AD9'</span>
) <span class="hljs-keyword">AND</span> port <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (<span class="hljs-number">18789</span>, <span class="hljs-number">18791</span>)
</code>
                <div class="code-actions"><div class="copy-trigger" style="width: 80px;
