<img src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+11.png" alt="Figure 11: Unique Header Hash (Murmur3) - 8,260 Results" title class="markdown-image" data-src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+11.png" data-alt="Figure 11: Unique Header Hash (Murmur3) - 8,260 Results" style="
                display: block;
