                font-weight: 400;
                margin-bottom: 2em;
                display: block;
                font-style: italic;
                margin-inline: auto;
                max-width: 80%;
            ">Figure 11: Unique Header Hash (Murmur3) - 8,260 Results</span><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">This version relies on deduplicated header names to confirm the same fingerprint using a minimal header set.</p><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         "><strong>Query (Unique Header Hash):</strong></p><pre><code class="language-sql"><code class=" language-sql" data-raw="SELECT ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
FROM httpv2
WHERE http.headers.unique.hash.murmur3 IN (
    '01D737B6D4249593',
    'A21D8F4148A7091A',
    'B5B27B39C533B437',
    '75530A6460E2396C',
    '21DFA63A75ACFD53',
    'D263AF8ACFBCB72B',
    'A905FF566F28EC67',
    '2227E50E61F4757E',
    '91794924F783020C'
) AND port IN (18789, 18791)
"><span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
<span class="hljs-keyword">FROM</span> httpv2
<span class="hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> http.headers.unique.hash.murmur3 <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (
    <span class="hljs-string">'01D737B6D4249593'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'A21D8F4148A7091A'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'B5B27B39C533B437'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'75530A6460E2396C'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'21DFA63A75ACFD53'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'D263AF8ACFBCB72B'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'A905FF566F28EC67'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'2227E50E61F4757E'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'91794924F783020C'</span>
) <span class="hljs-keyword">AND</span> port <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (<span class="hljs-number">18789</span>, <span class="hljs-number">18791</span>)
</code>
                <div class="code-actions"><div class="copy-trigger" style="width: 80px;
                    padding: unset !important;
                    display: flex;
                    justify-content: center;
                    align-items: center;
                    text-align: center;
