                font-weight: 400;
                margin-bottom: 2em;
                display: block;
                font-style: italic;
                margin-inline: auto;
                max-width: 80%;
            ">Figure 13: Body Hash (SHA256) with Port Filter - 6,801 Results</span><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">This variant applies Murmur3 body hashing to support faster matching across large datasets.</p><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         "><strong>Query (Murmur3 Body Hash):</strong></p><pre><code class="language-sql"><code class=" language-sql" data-raw="SELECT ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
FROM httpv2
WHERE html.body.hash.murmur3 IN (
    '2683260611',
    '2640755433',
    '885981446',
    '3742799908',
    '1008552787',
    '743781550',
    '44186107',
    '1133263748',
    '1208028788'
)
AND port IN (18789, 18791)
"><span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
<span class="hljs-keyword">FROM</span> httpv2
<span class="hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> html.body.hash.murmur3 <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (
    <span class="hljs-string">'2683260611'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'2640755433'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'885981446'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'3742799908'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'1008552787'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'743781550'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'44186107'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'1133263748'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'1208028788'</span>
)
<span class="hljs-keyword">AND</span> port <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (<span class="hljs-number">18789</span>, <span class="hljs-number">18791</span>)
</code>
                <div class="code-actions"><div class="copy-trigger" style="width: 80px;
