             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">Output example:</p><img src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+14.png" alt="Figure 14: Body Hash (Murmur3) - 6,839 Results" title class="markdown-image" data-src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+14.png" data-alt="Figure 14: Body Hash (Murmur3) - 6,839 Results" style="
                display: block;
                margin: 1em auto -1em auto;
                max-width: 85%;
                max-height: 600px;
                cursor: zoom-in;
                overflow: hidden;
                border-radius: 6px;
                box-shadow: -1px 4px 23px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);"><span class="figure" style="
                font-size: 14px;
                color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
                font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.5;
                margin-top: 1.2em;
                text-align: center;
                font-weight: 400;
                margin-bottom: 2em;
                display: block;
                font-style: italic;
                margin-inline: auto;
                max-width: 80%;
            ">Figure 14: Body Hash (Murmur3) - 6,839 Results</span><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">This approach uses TLSH fuzzy hashing to identify instances with minor HTML modifications or customized builds.</p><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         "><strong>Query (TLSH Fuzzy Body Hash):</strong></p><pre><code class="language-sql"><code class=" language-sql" data-raw="SELECT ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
FROM httpv2
WHERE html.body.hash.tlsh IN (
    'dc019e0158a08a3773a4432815e6fd186e52a2434789ea4475dbb07d0fc5b93c9db4ec',
    '4e01fe0198a08e1733b4423419b6f8482e6262470789da4075da703c4ec9ba2c9db4f8',
    '09019e4198a08a3773a44422419e6fc186e62a243038def4475db703d1ec5ba2c9db4ec',
    '72011241889089l733a093388ba3bc249a42a24b4b1a5f4435c6307d6fe4fd34ddf4f8',
    'a9011241c8d08d1723a092348ba3bc649a42a24b4b1a5f4435c6307d6fe4bd389df4f8',
    'e601fe0188a08e1733b4422419e2f8582e666143038ada4075da703c4ec8ba2c9db4f8',
    '0801fe0188a08e1733b4422415a6f8482e626143038ada4075da703d1fc8ba2c9db4f8',
    '1501230818e1733f4423419e2fc482e626143038ada4075da703c0fc8ba2cddb4fc',
    '5b019e0598a08a3773b4432815e7fc186e52a2434789eb4475dfb03d0ec5b82c9db4dc'
)
AND port IN (18789, 18791)
"><span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
<span class="hljs-keyword">FROM</span> httpv2
<span class="hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> html.body.hash.tlsh <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (
    <span class="hljs-string">'dc019e0158a08a3773a4432815e6fd186e52a2434789ea4475dbb07d0fc5b93c9db4ec'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'4e01fe0198a08e1733b4423419b6f8482e6262470789da4075da703c4ec9ba2c9db4f8'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'09019e4198a08a3773a44422419e6fc186e62a243038def4475db703d1ec5ba2c9db4ec'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'72011241889089l733a093388ba3bc249a42a24b4b1a5f4435c6307d6fe4fd34ddf4f8'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'a9011241c8d08d1723a092348ba3bc649a42a24b4b1a5f4435c6307d6fe4bd389df4f8'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'e601fe0188a08e1733b4422419e2f8582e666143038ada4075da703c4ec8ba2c9db4f8'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'0801fe0188a08e1733b4422415a6f8482e626143038ada4075da703d1fc8ba2c9db4f8'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'1501230818e1733f4423419e2fc482e626143038ada4075da703c0fc8ba2cddb4fc'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-string">'5b019e0598a08a3773b4432815e7fc186e52a2434789eb4475dfb03d0ec5b82c9db4dc'</span>
)
<span class="hljs-keyword">AND</span> port <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (<span class="hljs-number">18789</span>, <span class="hljs-number">18791</span>)
</code>
