<p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">Output example:</p><img src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+15.png" alt="Figure 15: Body Hash (TLSH Fuzzy) with Port Filter - 6,839 Results" title class="markdown-image" data-src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+15.png" data-alt="Figure 15: Body Hash (TLSH Fuzzy) with Port Filter - 6,839 Results" style="
                display: block;
                margin: 1em auto -1em auto;
                max-width: 85%;
                max-height: 600px;
                cursor: zoom-in;
                overflow: hidden;
                border-radius: 6px;
                box-shadow: -1px 4px 23px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);"><span class="figure" style="
                font-size: 14px;
                color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
                font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.5;
                margin-top: 1.2em;
                text-align: center;
                font-weight: 400;
                margin-bottom: 2em;
                display: block;
                font-style: italic;
                margin-inline: auto;
                max-width: 80%;
            ">Figure 15: Body Hash (TLSH Fuzzy) with Port Filter - 6,839 Results</span><h3 style="font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 1.2em;">Detection Strategy 5: JavaScript and CSS Asset Fingerprints</h3><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">Modern web applications built with bundlers like Vite include content-addressed asset filenames that incorporate hash values derived from the file contents. For OpenClaw, this means each version release produces unique JavaScript and CSS filenames such as "index-Cl-Y9zqE.js" or "index-DEPfFcOb.css". These hashed filenames serve as version-specific identifiers that remain constant across all deployments of the same build.</p><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">By searching for these distinctive asset filenames within the HTML body content, we can identify OpenClaw instances and even determine which specific version they are running. This information is valuable for vulnerability assessment, as different versions may have different security patches applied. The asset fingerprinting approach found over 8,000 instances, providing strong coverage across the deployed population.</p><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">This approach remains effective even when minor interface changes are introduced, since asset hashes are embedded in the build process and require a full rebuild to change. Security teams can use these fingerprints to track version distribution and prioritize patching efforts for older, more vulnerable releases.</p><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">The next query identifies OpenClaw instances by matching version-specific JavaScript asset filenames embedded in the HTML.</p><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         "><strong>Query (JavaScript Assets):</strong></p><pre><code class="language-sql"><code class=" language-sql" data-raw="SELECT ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
FROM httpv2
WHERE (
    html.body.content LIKE '%index-Cl-Y9zqE.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-5xhVxegE.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-BCK1V83p.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-DFDgq9AK.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-CXUONUC9.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-CxUFDXFX.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-Bb7zaWmQ.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-DsXRcnEw.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-CxUwHlqZ.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-kjHVNdSc.js%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-RnF4fdeM.js%'
) AND port IN (18789, 18791)
"><span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
<span class="hljs-keyword">FROM</span> httpv2
<span class="hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> (
    html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-Cl-Y9zqE.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-5xhVxegE.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-BCK1V83p.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-DFDgq9AK.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-CXUONUC9.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-CxUFDXFX.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-Bb7zaWmQ.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-DsXRcnEw.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-CxUwHlqZ.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-kjHVNdSc.js%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-RnF4fdeM.js%'</span>
) <span class="hljs-keyword">AND</span> port <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (<span class="hljs-number">18789</span>, <span class="hljs-number">18791</span>)
</code>
                <div class="code-actions"><div class="copy-trigger" style="width: 80px;
                    padding: unset !important;
                    display: flex;
                    justify-content: center;
                    align-items: center;
                    text-align: center;
                    border-radius: 4px;
                    border: unset;
                    height: 30px;
                    box-sizing: border-box;
                    cursor: pointer;
                    gap: 4px;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy-icon lucide-copy"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/></svg><span>Copy</span></div></div></code></pre>
<p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">Output example:</p><img src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+16.png" alt="Figure 16: JavaScript Asset Fingerprints - 8,164 Results" title class="markdown-image" data-src="https://public-hunt-static-blog-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/2-2026/Hunting+OpenClaw+Exposures+CVE-2026-25253+in+Internet-Facing+AI+Agent+Gateways+-+figure+16.png" data-alt="Figure 16: JavaScript Asset Fingerprints - 8,164 Results" style="
                display: block;
                margin: 1em auto -1em auto;
                max-width: 85%;
                max-height: 600px;
                cursor: zoom-in;
                overflow: hidden;
                border-radius: 6px;
                box-shadow: -1px 4px 23px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);"><span class="figure" style="
                font-size: 14px;
                color: rgb(255, 255, 255);
                font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.5;
                margin-top: 1.2em;
                text-align: center;
                font-weight: 400;
                margin-bottom: 2em;
                display: block;
                font-style: italic;
                margin-inline: auto;
                max-width: 80%;
            ">Figure 16: JavaScript Asset Fingerprints - 8,164 Results</span><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         ">The following query applies the same technique using hashed CSS asset filenames to expand version coverage.</p><p style="
             font-size: 14px;
             color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
             line-height: 1.5;
             margin-top: 1.2em;
             margin-bottom: 2em;
             word-wrap: break-word;
         "><strong>Query (CSS Assets):</strong></p><pre><code class="language-sql"><code class=" language-sql" data-raw="SELECT ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
FROM httpv2
WHERE (
    html.body.content LIKE '%index-DEPfFcOb.css%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-BAFzd9IE.css%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-CjW_qQ45.css%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-BKPyesll.css%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-BvhR9FCb.css%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-BZkju1RS.css%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-CIRDm-Lu.css%'
    OR html.body.content LIKE '%index-O8nzABV3.css%'
)
AND port IN (18789, 18791)
"><span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> ip, port, hostname, html.head.title
<span class="hljs-keyword">FROM</span> httpv2
<span class="hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> (
    html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-DEPfFcOb.css%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-BAFzd9IE.css%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-CjW_qQ45.css%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-BKPyesll.css%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-BvhR9FCb.css%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-BZkju1RS.css%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-CIRDm-Lu.css%'</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> html.body.content <span class="hljs-keyword">LIKE</span> <span class="hljs-string">'%index-O8nzABV3.css%'</span>
)
<span class="hljs-keyword">AND</span> port <span class="hljs-keyword">IN</span> (<span class="hljs-number">18789</span>, <span class="hljs-number">18791</span>)
</code>
                <div class="code-actions"><div class="copy-trigger" style="width: 80px;
                    padding: unset !important;
                    display: flex;
                    justify-content: center;
                    align-items: center;
                    text-align: center;
